  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nithio FI is a Dutch domiciled renewable energy financing intermediary that applies geo-spatial data, advanced analytics, and machine learning algorithms to:
1) underwrite and finance pay-as-you-go (PAYG) receivables assets

2) lower the cost of funds and improve the efficiency in delivery of the underlying assets at a lower cost to the end consumer 

3) increase the level of capital deployed in the off-grid sector (OGS).</narrative>
